# “1.5 page” = official anniversary site

Canonical URL: https://1-5anniv-gget.ggame.jp/en/  
Locales: `/jp/` `/en/` `/sc/` `/hk/` `/tw/` `/kr/`

When the owner says **“1.5 page”**, this is the reference — study / mimic from here, not from gget.ggame.jp main marketing site.

## What it is

Bandai Namco **campaign microsite** (not the game client UI): splash → scroll story → campaign modules → store CTA. Built as a Vite/Rolldown ES module app with **GSAP + ScrollTrigger**, WebP art, SVG sprite HUD frames, `clip-path` chamfers.

