## Page architecture (live EN, Sep 2026)

1. **Splash / cover** (`l-cover`) — looping muted video + grid autoplay, emblem/anniversary marks  
2. **Visual countdown hero** (`l-visual-count-down`) — clipped media bg, SCROLL cue, campaign lead  
3. **Locus / journey** (`l-locus-of-the-post-six-month`) — scroll-triggered character/line timeline (“since 1st anniv”)  
4. **Comeback login bonus** (`l-comeback-login-bonus`) — dark-blue section title, period block, reward cards  
5. **And more + Download now** — store badges, legal, copyright  

JP may ship extra modules first (e.g. `l-game-media-interview`). CSS already contains **future** modules (history units, mini-game, UR unit frames, video modal) — treat as upcoming content, not missing bugs.

## Motion / interaction language

- Splash gate (`window._status.onSplash` / `splashCut`) then scroll unlock  
- GSAP title flicker / blink (`data-Interaction-blink`, `data-animation-title`)  
- ScrollTrigger once-enter for section timelines (`data-animation-item` / `timeline`)  
- Menu: slide-in drawer + language + social; header logo/anniversary hide on scroll  
- Soft easing (`power3`, custom `title-ease`), short opacity strobes — cinematic, not UI-busy  

## Mimic feasibility for ggen_db_app

**Good fits (when owner asks):** chamfer/corner-bracket frames, cyan↔gold accent pairing, section divider rules with triangle endcaps, Teko-like *display only* on promo surfaces, clipped hero media, blink/flicker micro-motion on CTAs, responsive `picture` 1x/2x WebP.

**Poor fits / do not copy wholesale:** full GSAP splash gate on database browse, Noto font swap (our fonts are locked), campaign microsite full-bleed video hero on `/`, mini-game / ScrollTrigger story pages inside the DB app, OneTrust/GTM stack.

**Rule of thumb:** borrow **HUD chrome + motion taste** for promotional / collections / What’s New surfaces; keep browse/detail/TB on our existing shell performance bar.

